# Published Anchor Profiles are byte-stable artefacts: their SHA-256 digests are
# recorded in EVIDENCE.md and re-computed by the test suite. Line-ending
# conversion would change those bytes on checkout and break the digests, so
# profiles are never subject to text conversion.
profiles/*.json -text

# An unindexed profile is a test failure, so the index itself must not be
# rewritten by tooling either.
profiles/manifest.json -text
